erryboy_hip/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/96c79175/uploads/origins/c5d5ccfd-60db-47db-8935-ade28bf305fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68736565249c356aca80efff79518cc4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/96c79175/uploads/origins/c5d5ccfd-60db-47db-8935-ade28bf305fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68736565249c356aca80efff79518cc4, https://si.imgix.net/96c79175/uploads/origins/c5d5ccfd-60db-47db-8935-ade28bf305fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5dd5161042e9bd8eb435ca3c64880ef0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/96c79175/uploads/origins/c5d5ccfd-60db-47db-8935-ade28bf305fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=002370e85f6d79f0d58c6d8de6949fbc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi there. I would love for you to draw my vtuber. He a friendly and chill angel/devil .Feel free to draw him in anyway you feel like.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1VGNXco9ZPO_IJ0s-NTjwyWNs28gLQJEC?usp=shagrin", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cherryboy_hip/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8832bad8/uploads/origins/e11e8b11-1e1c-4885-bbc2-67f485464c71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91b3b02bdfc24bba3e3929abfac4e327", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8832bad8/uploads/origins/e11e8b11-1e1c-4885-bbc2-67f485464c71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91b3b02bdfc24bba3e3929abfac4e327, https://si.imgix.net/8832bad8/uploads/origins/e11e8b11-1e1c-4885-bbc2-67f485464c71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e049997516218b839d74540efb32e0ab 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8832bad8/uploads/origins/e11e8b11-1e1c-4885-bbc2-67f485464c71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83c78ed36a17f2cb6692ec0c0ab24b0b 3x", "