rence URL\nhttps://tw6.jp/gallery/?id=67528(Full body view)\nhttps://tw6.jp/character/illust?character_id=f23530(Other illustrations)\nhttps://tw6.jp/character/status/f23530(profile)\n\nThe above is all that is required.\nThank you for your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cherryboy_hip/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a447d9fb/uploads/origins/014f6f4c-257e-414e-b39c-67d6fa3ea712?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3dd18d1528ec62bf6462380dd7966e31", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a447d9fb/uploads/origins/014f6f4c-257e-414e-b39c-67d6fa3ea712?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3dd18d1528ec62bf6462380dd7966e31, https://si.imgix.net/a447d9fb/uploads/origins/014f6f4c-257e-414e-b39c-67d6fa3ea712?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f760e4ba6d3885ec803ff8c1c8d0757 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a447d9fb/uploads/origins/014f6f4c-257e-414e-b39c-67d6fa3ea712?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8255c817e1375e30fbabd0ff9aa6b84 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Congratulations on the opening of Skeb!\nI need an illustration of Leftzawa M. Doria looking vaguely through a rainy window in a dimly lit room!\nIf it is ok, I would like to use it as a thumbnail for my YouTube video.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/aterazawa_m/status/1545958878084759553?s=21&t=72ug7FbjRj2FFqPgVYii5w", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}